00:03:36.659 --> 00:03:42.587
<v Host>On the third, Hanshin played the Hiroshima Carp at Mazda Stadium in Hiroshima.

00:03:43.187 --> 00:03:45.419
<v Vocab>試合

00:03:45.819 --> 00:03:48.003
<v Host>It means a game or match.

00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:56.379
<v Slow>この日、阪神は勝てば優勝が決まる「マジック1」でした。

00:03:57.180 --> 00:04:02.651
<v Host>That day, Hanshin's magic number was one: a win would clinch the title.

00:04:03.252 --> 00:04:05.412
<v Vocab>決まる

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:07.707
<v Host>It means to be decided.

00:04:08.307 --> 00:04:14.668
<v Slow>しかし、試合は4対6で負けてしまいました。

00:04:15.467 --> 00:04:18.276
<v Host>But they lost the game, four to six.

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:21.036
<v Vocab>負ける

00:04:21.435 --> 00:04:23.307
<v Host>It means to lose.

00:04:23.908 --> 00:04:32.091
<v Slow>その後、東京ドームで2位の巨人とDeNAの試合がありました。

00:04:32.891 --> 00:04:37.235
<v Host>Later, second-place Giants played DeNA at Tokyo Dome.

00:04:37.836 --> 00:04:40.091
