<v Host>It means after that.

00:04:42.963 --> 00:04:50.524
<v Slow>巨人が2対5で負けたため、阪神の優勝が決まりました。

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:56.172
<v Host>Because the Giants lost two to five, Hanshin's title was decided.

00:04:56.771 --> 00:04:58.668
<v Vocab>ため

00:04:59.067 --> 00:05:00.939
<v Host>It means because of.

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:07.851
<v Slow>阪神は、まだ4つの試合を残しています。

00:05:08.651 --> 00:05:11.651
<v Host>Hanshin still has four games left to play.

00:05:12.252 --> 00:05:14.627
<v Vocab>残す

00:05:15.028 --> 00:05:17.451
<v Host>It means to leave something remaining.

00:05:18.052 --> 00:05:25.468
<v Slow>監督の藤川球児さんは、監督になって2年目です。

00:05:26.267 --> 00:05:30.300
<v Host>Manager Kyuji Fujikawa is in his second year in the job.

00:05:30.899 --> 00:05:33.276
<v Vocab>監督

00:05:33.675 --> 00:05:35.620
<v Host>It means a team manager.

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:45.435
<v Slow>藤川監督は、1年目から2年続けてチームを優勝に導きました。

00:05:46.235 --> 00:05:51.971
<v Host>Fujikawa has led the team to the title two years running, starting from his first year.

00:05:52.572 --> 00:05:55.067
<v Vocab>導く

00:05:55.468 --> 00:05:57.795
<v Host>It means to lead or guide.

00:05:58.396 --> 00:06:09.100
<v Slow>3日の試合では、佐藤輝明選手が今シーズン39本目のホームランを打ちました。

00:06:09.899 --> 00:06:15.827
<v Host>In the game on the third, Teruaki Sato hit his thirty-ninth home run of the season.

00:06:16.427 --> 00:06:18.516
<v Vocab>打つ

00:06:18.915 --> 00:06:20.788
<v Host>It means to hit.

00:06:21.387 --> 00:06:30.004
<v Slow>コミッショナーは、強い打線や安定したピッチャーの活躍をほめました。

00:06:30.803 --> 00:06:35.795
<v Host>The league commissioner praised the strong batting lineup and the steady pitchers.

00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:38.651
<v Vocab>安定

00:06:39.052 --> 00:06:41.259
<v Host>It means stable or steady.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:50.451
<v Slow>阪神は、14日から始まるクライマックスシリーズに出場します。

00:06:51.252 --> 00:06:56.028
<v Host>Hanshin will play in the Climax Series playoffs starting on the fourteenth.

00:06:56.627 --> 00:06:59.004
<v Vocab>出場

00:06:59.403 --> 00:07:02.187
<v Host>It means to take part in a competition.

00:07:02.788 --> 00:07:09.771
<v Slow>そして、9回目の日本シリーズを目指して戦います。

00:07:10.572 --> 00:07:14.244
<v Host>They will fight for their ninth trip to the Japan Series.

00:07:14.843 --> 00:07:17.172
